                            attribute on each
                            <code>.accordion-collapse</code>
                            to make accordion items stay open when another item is opened.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="prism-toggle">
                        <SpkButtons ButtonClass="btn-primary-light" ButtonSize="btn-sm">Show Code<i class="ri-code-line ms-2 d-inline-block align-middle"></i></SpkButtons>
